000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID.    TAXCALC2.
000300 AUTHOR.       J WEXLER.
000400 DATE-WRITTEN. 02/14/06.
000500*------------------------------------------------------------
000600* TAXCALC2 - QUARTERLY WITHHOLDING. REPLACES TAXCALC (2006).
000700* RUN BY JOB TAXQTR.
000800*------------------------------------------------------------
000900 DATA DIVISION.
001000 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001100 01  WS-ADDRESS.
001200     COPY ADDRREC.
001300 01  WS-PARM.
001400     COPY TAXPARM.
001500 01  WS-GROSS               PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
001600 01  WS-TAX                 PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
001700 01  WS-YY                  PIC 99 VALUE ZERO.
001800 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
001900 0000-MAIN.
002000     PERFORM 1000-CALC
002100     CALL 'TAXVEND' USING WS-ADDRESS WS-TAX
002200     GOBACK.
002300 1000-CALC.
002400     COMPUTE WS-TAX ROUNDED = WS-GROSS * TP-RATE
002500     IF ADR-STATE = 'NY'
002600        ADD 1 TO WS-TAX
002700     END-IF.
002800 8000-Y2K-WINDOW.
002900     IF WS-YY < 50
003000        COMPUTE TP-YEAR = 2000 + WS-YY
003100     ELSE
003200        COMPUTE TP-YEAR = 1900 + WS-YY
003300     END-IF.
